title: "p4"
abstract: "Two Claude Code plugins: p4-phi, which keeps what linked sessions hand each other and retrieval from the project's own history; and p4-temportal, which keeps what stands in for a default of Anthropic's own system: the auto memory directory, the session scratchpad directory, temp files and their lifetimes."
